meta-fzhub
==========

This layer contains product-specific metadata for the RK3568-based FZHub platform.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core
  layer: meta
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-rockchip
  layer: meta-rockchip
  branch: wrynose

The meta-rockchip layer also requires meta-arm.

Machine support
===============

The initial `fzhub` MACHINE inherits the RK3568 SoC defaults. It is a skeleton
until its device tree, U-Boot defconfig, and image layout are defined, and is
not yet sufficient for a bootable hardware image.
